  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing COVID-19 exacerbated  humanitarian needs of older people, people with disabilities and other vulnerable groups in seven refugee camps</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will bring increased awareness and protection of vulnerable refugees, including older men and women, PwDs and other refugee and host community groups against COVID-19 through supply of PPE and continuous awareness. Furthermore it will support an increase in nutrition and health services availability for vulnerable refugee men and women through supply of fresh food through voucher system and continuous home-based care assistance</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to the protection and lifesaving needs of older people, PwDs and PSNs in protracted emergency in seven refugee camps of Gambella.</narrative>
  </description>
